{"message":"I verified your identity and reviewed your four card accounts and 47 posted transactions. Rho-Bank’s system stores cash back as “points”; for cash-back cards, 1 point equals $0.01 when redeemed as a statement or checking-account credit. The EcoCard uses points as well, earning 5 points per dollar on Green purchases and 1 point per dollar elsewhere.

The Silver Rewards Card transactions I reviewed appear consistent with its 4% Travel/Software rate—for example, Southwest Airlines earned 1,295 points on $323.89, and Microsoft 365 earned 319 points on $79.99. EcoCard Green purchases also appear consistent with 5 points per dollar.

To investigate a specific discrepancy, please provide the transaction ID shown on your statement, or the transaction date, merchant, amount, card, and points/cash back received versus expected. I can then confirm the transaction ID and help you submit the cash-back dispute."}

